<script setup lang="ts">import {computed} from 'vue';import {fixed,probability,logValue} from '../utils/format';const props=defineProps<{result:any}>();const base=computed(()=>props.result.analysis.baseline);const legacy=computed(()=>base.value.log_normalizer===undefined);const weights=computed(()=>props.result.analysis.weights||{});const weightText=computed(()=>Object.entries(weights.value).map(([k,v]:[string,any])=>k+'=['+v.join(',')+']').join(' · '));</script><template><div class="probability-summary"><div><small>查询 {{result.snapshot.target}} / P(状态1 | E)</small><strong>{{probability(base.posterior[1].probability,base.posterior[1].probability_underflow)}}</strong><span>给定模型后验，不是先验或现实故障率</span></div><div><small>H(Q | E) / log₂</small><strong>{{fixed(result.analysis.target_entropy,6)}} <em>bit</em></strong><span>候选仅未观测、非目标节点</span></div><div v-if="legacy"><small>log Z / 自然对数</small><strong>{{logValue(base.log_evidence)}}</strong><span>Z {{probability(base.evidence_probability,base.evidence_probability_underflow)}}；证据可行</span></div><template v-else><div><small>加权归一常数 log Z / ln</small><strong>{{logValue(base.log_normalizer)}}</strong><span>含软权重；Z {{probability(base.normalizer_probability,base.normalizer_underflow)}}，不是证据概率</span></div><div><small>证据概率 log P(E) / ln</small><strong>{{logValue(base.log_evidence_probability)}}</strong><span>P(E) {{probability(base.evidence_probability,base.evidence_probability_underflow)}}；确定性证据分母</span></div></template></div><p class="method-note" v-if="!legacy">软权重 {{weightText||'无'}}；只按同一案例内相对可信度解释，同比缩放不改变后验。P(E) 与加权logZ分开留存。</p></template>
